  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Adaptation Acceleration Program (AAAP) 2022-2026 - Process consultancy for preparation and programme formulation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the assignment is to support the effective preparation of the Danish support for 2022-2026 to AAAP and elaboration of the Programme Document to a level of standard enabling it to be submitted for approval and which addresses the key issues arising from assessments and discussions between the Ministry of Foreign Affairs (MFA), AfDB, GCA, C40 and other key stakeholders.</narrative>
